WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.060 --> 01:38.900
[Episode 2]

01:43.160 --> 01:44.620
Isn't it odd?

01:45.350 --> 01:46.810
We've been living with Master all this while

01:47.670 --> 01:49.300
and we never knew he knew martial arts.

01:50.510 --> 01:51.730
Everyone has their secrets.

01:52.070 --> 01:53.050
We didn't tell him

01:53.070 --> 01:54.580
about the Green Vial either.

01:55.960 --> 01:57.810
He treats you like his own son.

01:58.190 --> 01:59.210
Why are you doubting him?

02:00.160 --> 02:00.770
I've been practicing

02:00.770 --> 02:01.740
Mammoth Skin for a long time.

02:02.030 --> 02:03.490
I was punched. I was in pain.

02:04.030 --> 02:04.850
And I never complain.

02:05.760 --> 02:06.530
That's different.

02:07.070 --> 02:08.130
He killed someone.

02:09.790 --> 02:11.300
Wu Yan was in the Wild Wolves Gang.

02:11.430 --> 02:12.410
He betrayed Seven Mysteries Sect.

02:12.560 --> 02:13.130
He deserves death.

02:13.430 --> 02:14.900
Besides, Master did it to save you.

02:16.030 --> 02:17.050
That doesn't even make sense.

02:17.600 --> 02:18.500
Am I that important?

02:18.670 --> 02:19.900
Of course.

02:20.390 --> 02:21.730
Master has reserved the best for you.

02:22.920 --> 02:24.860
He taught you how to heal and how to read.

02:25.320 --> 02:26.650
He's nice to you.

02:29.790 --> 02:30.330
It's raining.

02:30.710 --> 02:31.300
Go back to sleep.

02:31.470 --> 02:32.050
Zhang Tie.

02:32.470 --> 02:32.940
Zhang Tie!

02:46.930 --> 02:48.490
Did I overthink it?

02:59.480 --> 03:00.460
Are you leaving the mountain for real?

03:01.950 --> 03:03.690
Your lack of progress

03:04.000 --> 03:06.620
is tied to the herb's inefficiency.

03:07.200 --> 03:09.380
I have thought about it

03:10.200 --> 03:12.410
and decided to find better herbs for you.

03:13.280 --> 03:14.620
But are you sure you're well enough to do this?

03:15.280 --> 03:16.490
I can come with you.

03:17.430 --> 03:18.380
No need.

03:18.480 --> 03:19.020
Zhang Tie.

03:19.400 --> 03:20.570
Stay here

03:21.310 --> 03:22.330
and take care

03:22.560 --> 03:23.740
of Han Li and his cultivation.

03:24.070 --> 03:26.180
You'll be punished if he makes no progress

03:27.590 --> 03:29.020
once I'm back.

03:33.790 --> 03:34.210
Go back now.

03:34.350 --> 03:34.900
No need to see me off.

03:35.590 --> 03:36.050
Farewell.

03:38.640 --> 03:39.850
For the next year or so,

03:40.680 --> 03:42.180
Physician Mo often left for months at a time

03:43.430 --> 03:43.980
to search

03:44.360 --> 03:45.290
for herbs.

03:46.520 --> 03:47.100
Everything seemed

03:47.910 --> 03:50.060
to turn back to the way it was before.

03:50.540 --> 03:52.860
[Four Years Later in the Valley]

04:10.310 --> 04:10.850
Senior Li.

04:37.710 --> 04:38.340
I am Han Li.

04:38.750 --> 04:39.290
Senior Li,

04:39.960 --> 04:40.450
you...

04:42.150 --> 04:43.130
Your condition puzzles me.

04:43.800 --> 04:44.610
I can only seal your pressure points

04:44.680 --> 04:45.660
with my needles for the moment.

04:46.560 --> 04:47.690
Did you ingest any herbs previously?

04:49.190 --> 04:52.730
They are...

05:06.960 --> 05:07.660
This?

05:17.840 --> 05:18.890
This pill is made from Helan,

05:19.190 --> 05:19.890
Scorpion Flower,

05:20.240 --> 05:22.100
Blue Ant Eggs, and around thirty other rare herbs.

05:22.870 --> 05:23.570
It is red

05:24.310 --> 05:25.660
and repugnant.

05:26.030 --> 05:26.820
Once you ingest it,

05:27.080 --> 05:27.890
even your bones will ache.

05:28.630 --> 05:29.610
Thus, it's called Bone Agony Pill.

05:30.240 --> 05:30.850
It

05:31.280 --> 05:32.380
brings out your potential

05:32.630 --> 05:33.410
and makes you stronger.

05:34.190 --> 05:35.130
But the caveat

05:35.520 --> 05:36.500
is that it costs your life

05:36.630 --> 05:37.660
and comes with detrimental side effects.

05:41.310 --> 05:42.730
You should stop taking these pills.

05:43.080 --> 05:43.780
If you continue,

05:44.280 --> 05:45.610
you'll have at most ten years left to live.

06:28.310 --> 06:30.140
Give me a reason to spare you.

06:33.480 --> 06:34.410
I saved you.

06:35.160 --> 06:36.250
Is that not a good reason?

06:37.680 --> 06:38.340
Truth be told,

06:39.000 --> 06:40.290
I did wonder if I would be killed

06:41.190 --> 06:42.290
after saving you.

06:43.560 --> 06:44.540
Who would have thought

06:45.160 --> 06:46.250
that you'd turn your back on me this soon?

06:49.360 --> 06:49.930
I swear

06:50.750 --> 06:51.780
I won't tell anyone.

06:53.000 --> 06:54.340
Your promise means nothing.

06:56.390 --> 06:57.290
Surely you know

06:57.800 --> 06:59.340
that I'm Physician Mo's final disciple.

07:00.040 --> 07:01.580
That old man has many disciples.

07:02.800 --> 07:03.980
It doesn't matter if you're the final disciple or not.

07:04.240 --> 07:04.730
It does.

07:06.270 --> 07:07.220
I study medicine under him.

07:07.480 --> 07:08.170
I can treat

07:09.430 --> 07:10.250
your condition.

07:11.390 --> 07:12.410
That pill comes with grave side effects.

07:13.120 --> 07:14.370
You will be gripped with excruciating pain

07:14.560 --> 07:15.580
that you wish you could die right away.

07:16.600 --> 07:17.810
I might not be able to save you

07:19.390 --> 07:20.900
but I can alleviate your suffering.

07:25.390 --> 07:26.340
How?

07:30.240 --> 07:31.930
With your blade on my neck,

07:33.190 --> 07:34.140
I can't think properly.

07:34.510 --> 07:35.290
I can't recall anything.

07:49.080 --> 07:49.830
Han Li,

07:50.240 --> 07:51.580
I apologize for my conduct.

07:52.190 --> 07:53.540
You saved me today

07:54.190 --> 07:55.700
and swore to keep this a secret.

07:56.120 --> 07:57.490
I owe you one.

08:01.160 --> 08:01.810
The medicine

08:02.360 --> 08:03.100
will be ready in three days.

08:03.870 --> 08:04.810
We'll meet here.

08:05.930 --> 08:06.780
Deal.

08:07.480 --> 08:08.170
It's a promise.

08:16.390 --> 08:17.580
I almost got myself killed.

08:18.510 --> 08:19.900
I won't intervene as readily anymore.

08:23.070 --> 08:23.580
Still,

08:24.240 --> 08:25.610
Li Feiyu said Master

08:26.120 --> 08:27.610
had many disciples.

08:28.430 --> 08:29.950
Why have I never seen anyone else here?

08:38.950 --> 08:39.490
Zhang Tie.

08:40.240 --> 08:40.780
You're back.

08:40.870 --> 08:41.290
I...

08:42.390 --> 08:43.460
Why are you sweating so much?

08:45.480 --> 08:46.490
I ran back for the food.

08:47.120 --> 08:47.980
The food is ready.

08:48.120 --> 08:49.340
What are we having today?

08:49.750 --> 08:51.490
Water dropwort broth and black rice.

08:51.600 --> 08:52.580
As usual.

10:18.030 --> 10:18.770
You're awake.

10:22.320 --> 10:23.370
You sat here for one whole day.

10:23.390 --> 10:24.060
Did you know that?

10:25.480 --> 10:27.180
You've been sitting here since last morning

10:27.200 --> 10:27.890
when I left to gather wood.

10:28.240 --> 10:29.220
When I came back for lunch,

10:29.240 --> 10:29.820
you were still here.

10:30.480 --> 10:31.180
I slept.

10:31.200 --> 10:32.300
And when I woke up, you were still here.

10:32.620 --> 10:33.530
You were like a statue.

10:34.320 --> 10:35.650
If I hadn't checked your breathing,

10:35.960 --> 10:37.370
I would have thought you were dead.

10:41.270 --> 10:42.100
That long?

10:42.670 --> 10:43.180
I reheated

10:43.390 --> 10:44.890
the food several times.

10:46.360 --> 10:47.300
I don't lie.

11:04.720 --> 11:05.530
Time flies.

11:07.120 --> 11:08.460
I merely had a dream.

11:09.840 --> 11:11.100
I think Master is back.

11:12.270 --> 11:13.100
Let me see.

11:15.510 --> 11:16.770
One whole day

11:17.360 --> 11:18.340
without food.

11:20.790 --> 11:21.980
Why am I not hungry?

11:25.600 --> 11:27.130
Is it because of the mantra?

11:30.480 --> 11:31.940
They say only immortals don't get hungry.

11:33.000 --> 11:33.730
Han Li!

11:34.120 --> 11:35.370
Come!

11:35.720 --> 11:36.580
Han Li!

11:37.030 --> 11:37.650
Come!

11:38.480 --> 11:39.010
Han Li!

11:39.360 --> 11:40.530
Master is dying!

11:42.870 --> 11:43.770
Quick.

11:44.550 --> 11:45.650
I can't heal.

11:45.840 --> 11:46.340
Master...

11:46.510 --> 11:47.820
Master is dying!

11:48.790 --> 11:49.220
Master!

11:49.630 --> 11:50.130
Master!

11:50.960 --> 11:51.770
Hurry up!

11:57.120 --> 11:57.460
Han Li!

11:57.480 --> 11:58.890
Quick!

11:58.910 --> 11:59.370
Get me some water.

12:01.320 --> 12:01.940
Master.

12:03.670 --> 12:04.610
Caihuai,

12:05.030 --> 12:06.250
is that you?

12:06.320 --> 12:07.010
Master,

12:07.030 --> 12:07.530
it's me.

12:07.670 --> 12:08.530
I'm Han Li.

12:09.790 --> 12:10.460
You'll be fine.

12:10.600 --> 12:11.220
You'll be fine.

12:11.240 --> 12:11.700
I...

12:12.150 --> 12:13.300
You just have to take some medicine.

12:13.320 --> 12:14.060
I...

12:14.120 --> 12:14.580
Master.

12:14.600 --> 12:15.200
Han Li.

12:15.200 --> 12:15.940
I'm here.

12:15.960 --> 12:16.820
- Han Li. - I'm here.

12:17.030 --> 12:17.770
I'm here.

12:24.670 --> 12:25.060
Master,

12:25.200 --> 12:25.940
you're hurting me.

12:31.600 --> 12:33.340
Oh, my.

12:34.750 --> 12:37.420
You have ascended to Tier 3 of the Longevity Art.

12:37.620 --> 12:40.120
[Longevity Art, Tier 3]

12:40.120 --> 12:40.980
I didn't know that.

12:41.320 --> 12:42.340
When I was training,

12:43.390 --> 12:44.420
something got into me.

12:44.600 --> 12:45.460
I had a dream.

12:46.240 --> 12:46.940
In that dream,

12:47.550 --> 12:49.250
there was a vortex on my tummy

12:49.840 --> 12:51.460
that could absorb spiritual aura from my surroundings.

12:52.870 --> 12:53.370
That's

12:53.670 --> 12:54.490
Tier 3?

12:54.960 --> 12:56.180
My child,

12:56.390 --> 12:57.610
that is not a dream.

12:57.790 --> 12:58.660
Zhang Tie!

12:59.750 --> 13:00.130
Go

13:00.720 --> 13:01.300
to the herb cabinet.

13:01.600 --> 13:02.250
Third row,

13:02.480 --> 13:04.100
second column from the left.

13:04.200 --> 13:06.130
There's a white vial inside a small box.

13:06.150 --> 13:07.100
Bring it to me.

13:07.720 --> 13:08.340
Yes!

13:12.240 --> 13:12.940
That's not a dream.

13:13.120 --> 13:14.130
That's not a dream.

13:14.550 --> 13:15.100
My child,

13:15.120 --> 13:15.890
the day has come.

13:15.960 --> 13:17.250
I'm so happy.

13:17.600 --> 13:18.700
That's meditation.

13:19.030 --> 13:20.130
That's inner eye.

13:21.600 --> 13:23.820
My hard work has paid off.

13:23.910 --> 13:25.610
The day has...

13:29.320 --> 13:29.610
Great.

13:33.960 --> 13:34.890
Bone Agony Pill?

13:44.840 --> 13:46.100
Even Li Feiyu knows

13:46.550 --> 13:47.610
how detrimental it can be.

13:48.480 --> 13:49.610
Surely Master knows too.

13:58.720 --> 13:59.250
Master.

14:05.150 --> 14:07.820
My disciple.

14:10.030 --> 14:12.940
My beloved disciple.

14:21.360 --> 14:22.460
Han Li.

14:23.720 --> 14:25.010
My hard work has paid off.

14:25.960 --> 14:27.100
It has paid off.

14:29.600 --> 14:30.650
The greed in his eyes

14:31.240 --> 14:32.940
is unsettling.

14:33.550 --> 14:34.340
It's as if

14:34.790 --> 14:36.010
he's not looking at a human being,

14:36.840 --> 14:38.220
but an object.

14:52.910 --> 14:54.420
You sure are punctual, Han Li.

14:54.910 --> 14:56.100
The hour of Wu three days later.

14:56.510 --> 14:58.130
It is precisely the hour of Wu now.

15:01.550 --> 15:02.340
This will last for a month.

15:04.140 --> 15:05.220
That's all?

15:05.930 --> 15:06.680
I

15:06.790 --> 15:08.180
have run out of herbs.

15:08.870 --> 15:09.890
I need time to gather the rest.

15:11.750 --> 15:12.940
So be it.

15:14.030 --> 15:15.010
Thank you, Han Li.

15:20.080 --> 15:20.940
What is the meaning of this?

15:22.080 --> 15:22.700
This concoction

15:22.790 --> 15:23.980
uses rhinoceros horns as base.

15:24.720 --> 15:25.700
I won't count the other costs.

15:26.480 --> 15:27.460
Just give me two taels.

15:28.440 --> 15:29.300
Can I pay you next month?

15:31.030 --> 15:31.980
If you don't have money,

15:32.960 --> 15:34.250
you can give me something else.

15:35.550 --> 15:36.130
You do

15:36.750 --> 15:37.700
have a fancy blade.

15:39.120 --> 15:39.980
Not this blade.

15:41.440 --> 15:42.730
What about a favor then?

15:43.720 --> 15:44.890
A favor again.

15:45.440 --> 15:46.730
If you need help, come to me.

15:47.200 --> 15:47.890
I'll

15:48.150 --> 15:48.820
help you.

15:56.440 --> 15:57.220
Why

15:57.720 --> 15:58.650
are you taking the pills?

16:02.440 --> 16:04.610
You need an edge if you want a place

16:04.910 --> 16:06.180
in the martial arts world.

16:06.720 --> 16:09.060
I used to think that life is short.

16:09.270 --> 16:11.060
I would rather fight for the present and not for a legacy.

16:11.720 --> 16:13.010
The pills can give me what I want.

16:13.550 --> 16:15.220
My health is a worthy sacrifice.

16:16.320 --> 16:17.890
But now, I...

16:19.480 --> 16:20.250
Well, forget it.

16:21.630 --> 16:22.770
Thank you for the concoction.

16:23.840 --> 16:24.610
See you next month.

16:28.630 --> 16:29.530
Fight for the present

16:29.870 --> 16:30.730
and not for a legacy.

16:32.240 --> 16:33.770
What does Master want then?

16:48.150 --> 16:48.890
Master!

16:50.910 --> 16:51.490
The pot is here.

16:52.550 --> 16:53.100
Master,

16:53.390 --> 16:54.730
I spent the whole afternoon

16:55.120 --> 16:56.130
looking for a pot.

16:56.320 --> 16:57.890
They said no need to return it to them this soon.

16:58.030 --> 16:59.220
Just return it to them once we're done.

17:00.550 --> 17:00.980
Master,

17:01.120 --> 17:01.820
let me cook

17:02.320 --> 17:03.130
some of your favorite tofus.

17:03.720 --> 17:04.250
Sure.

17:07.030 --> 17:09.370
You're so thoughtful, Zhang Tie.

17:09.600 --> 17:11.180
Why don't the three of us

17:12.790 --> 17:13.890
have a toast together?

17:15.870 --> 17:16.220
Sure.

17:19.720 --> 17:20.220
Master,

17:21.440 --> 17:22.340
take care of your health.

17:23.720 --> 17:24.530
Just one sip.

17:24.790 --> 17:25.890
It won't kill me.

17:29.320 --> 17:30.610
Let me fill the bowl for Master.

17:33.080 --> 17:34.010
Then, for Han Li.

17:35.240 --> 17:36.180
I'll have one too.

17:38.840 --> 17:39.580
On behalf of Zhang Tie and me,

17:39.600 --> 17:40.820
we raise our bowls

17:41.510 --> 17:42.650
to wish Master a life of longevity.

17:42.750 --> 17:43.580
May you live

17:44.120 --> 17:44.980
to one hundred years old.

17:46.440 --> 17:48.420
One hundred years old?

17:48.840 --> 17:50.700
I'm happy to see another day.

17:58.720 --> 17:59.250
Master.

18:01.030 --> 18:01.530
Come.

18:02.120 --> 18:02.820
Master.

18:03.200 --> 18:04.100
Allow me to say a toast.

18:04.670 --> 18:06.490
It's my fourth year here in the valley.

18:06.910 --> 18:08.010
You taught me Mammoth Skin

18:08.360 --> 18:09.980
and many things.

18:10.360 --> 18:12.060
You even allowed me to clear my debt.

18:12.550 --> 18:13.010
I...

18:13.320 --> 18:14.100
I'm not good with words.

18:14.150 --> 18:14.850
Let this toast speak for itself.

18:33.270 --> 18:34.250
Why do I feel dizzy?

18:36.390 --> 18:36.890
Master.

18:37.390 --> 18:38.010
Excuse him.

18:39.000 --> 18:40.180
Bring him back.

18:40.920 --> 18:43.380
I'm sick of coddling him

18:43.790 --> 18:44.980
like a child.

18:45.640 --> 18:46.050
Let's go.

18:46.440 --> 18:46.860
Master,

18:46.920 --> 18:47.490
I'll be back soon.

18:47.640 --> 18:48.380
Where is Master?

18:50.510 --> 18:51.010
Master.

19:14.000 --> 19:14.770
If you don't see me

19:15.270 --> 19:16.220
tomorrow morning,

19:16.830 --> 19:17.940
[If you don't see me...]
leave the mountain at once.

19:18.640 --> 19:19.530
Do not return.

19:25.790 --> 19:26.420
Zhang Tie.

19:28.240 --> 19:28.810
Zhang Tie.

20:07.350 --> 20:07.980
Master.

20:23.750 --> 20:24.620
Today,

20:24.750 --> 20:26.380
you

20:26.590 --> 20:28.700
will read my pulse.

20:53.590 --> 20:54.810
Your pulse is disorderly,

20:56.000 --> 20:58.140
as if there are two qis circulating in your body.

20:59.550 --> 21:00.660
Wherever they go,

21:01.350 --> 21:02.730
they damage your Meridian system.

21:05.510 --> 21:06.420
If I may comment,

21:07.480 --> 21:08.570
based on your pulse,

21:10.070 --> 21:10.810
you...

21:12.110 --> 21:13.380
My days are numbered

21:14.240 --> 21:15.660
unless I find a cure.

21:23.440 --> 21:24.810
I know

21:25.000 --> 21:26.220
better than you

21:26.240 --> 21:28.860
how fragile my health is.

21:33.440 --> 21:34.290
Come, my child.

21:38.750 --> 21:40.290
On this special occasion,

21:41.440 --> 21:42.490
I am delighted to know

21:42.720 --> 21:44.330
that you've made progress.

21:46.200 --> 21:47.140
Hence,

21:47.350 --> 21:48.460
I

21:48.880 --> 21:50.140
would like

21:51.550 --> 21:53.810
to be honest with you.

22:07.350 --> 22:08.940
Time waits for no one.

22:09.160 --> 22:10.980
Black hair can turn into white in an instant.

22:11.750 --> 22:15.010
Guess how old I am.

22:16.680 --> 22:17.490
Around

22:18.310 --> 22:18.980
sixty

22:19.240 --> 22:20.010
or seventy years old.

22:30.420 --> 22:32.820
[Thirty]

22:35.540 --> 22:37.940
[Thirty Seven]

22:40.310 --> 22:42.810
37 after the new year.

22:52.350 --> 22:53.050
You don't trust me?

22:54.400 --> 22:55.050
Well,

22:55.440 --> 22:57.660
you can ask the third uncle

22:57.960 --> 22:59.660
of that outer disciple of Seven Mysteries Sect.

23:00.830 --> 23:02.380
He must have heard

23:02.960 --> 23:04.490
of Wondrous Hands,

23:04.590 --> 23:06.700
Mo Juren of Lanzhou.

23:12.550 --> 23:13.940
I am

23:14.030 --> 23:15.180
Mo Juren.

23:16.350 --> 23:17.730
Back then,

23:18.880 --> 23:20.660
I was as young as you.

23:22.680 --> 23:24.620
There was no ailment

23:25.730 --> 23:27.340
I couldn't cure

23:28.270 --> 23:29.770
and no toxin I couldn't remove.

23:30.830 --> 23:31.860
Alas,

23:32.960 --> 23:34.810
I can save everyone else

23:38.000 --> 23:39.620
but me.

23:41.400 --> 23:43.420
I was hurt by despicable beings.

23:45.240 --> 23:46.460
My knowledge

23:47.270 --> 23:49.330
keeps me alive.

23:52.510 --> 23:54.530
But this broken body

23:54.640 --> 23:56.330
can never recover!

24:08.960 --> 24:09.660
Master,

24:10.160 --> 24:11.770
you need to stop taking Bone Agony Pills.

24:14.830 --> 24:16.250
It makes you feel better immediately

24:16.640 --> 24:18.490
but it can never cure your condition.

24:24.030 --> 24:24.810
If you continue taking it,

24:25.110 --> 24:25.620
you...

24:26.440 --> 24:28.090
I know.

24:28.790 --> 24:29.460
The pills

24:29.510 --> 24:31.730
can only give me one more year.

24:32.350 --> 24:34.090
But the heavens are on my side.

24:34.750 --> 24:36.490
I have found

24:36.680 --> 24:38.010
a cure.

24:38.880 --> 24:39.530
Which is?

24:39.830 --> 24:41.090
You.

24:41.550 --> 24:42.220
Me?

24:42.750 --> 24:43.730
Only you

24:44.030 --> 24:46.660
can save me.

24:50.110 --> 24:51.460
I've raised you for so long.

24:51.640 --> 24:54.220
It's time for you to return the favor!

24:56.400 --> 24:58.570
Calm down.

25:02.240 --> 25:04.530
Calm down.

25:06.680 --> 25:07.250
Calm down.

25:11.030 --> 25:11.860
Han Li.

25:13.550 --> 25:16.010
You've been asking me

25:16.720 --> 25:18.700
what the purpose of the mantra is.

25:20.270 --> 25:21.980
I'll give you the answer now.

25:25.510 --> 25:26.770
In effect,

25:27.070 --> 25:27.940
I need

25:28.110 --> 25:30.570
the qi of a Tier 4 cultivator

25:31.070 --> 25:32.460
using that mantra

25:32.550 --> 25:33.860
to stimulate my hidden pressure points.

25:34.310 --> 25:34.980
That

25:35.110 --> 25:36.420
will cure my condition.

25:37.400 --> 25:38.980
Not only will it remove the toxin in me,

25:39.550 --> 25:40.380
it also

25:41.030 --> 25:43.220
restores my youth.

25:47.830 --> 25:49.330
That's why you picked me.

25:51.110 --> 25:51.700
Is that so?

25:52.310 --> 25:53.770
Not me.

25:56.240 --> 25:58.380
That mantra picked you.

25:59.440 --> 26:00.730
Only the fated ones

26:01.070 --> 26:02.730
can cultivate the mantra.

26:03.880 --> 26:05.730
Even I cannot.

26:06.550 --> 26:07.530
Before you came,

26:07.640 --> 26:09.420
I had tens of disciples.

26:09.880 --> 26:12.290
None of them was as fortunate as you.

26:15.240 --> 26:16.220
Had you not appeared,

26:17.160 --> 26:17.900
I would have

26:18.680 --> 26:19.700
accepted my demise.

26:21.270 --> 26:23.290
Everyone dies eventually.

26:26.400 --> 26:27.770
But we crossed paths.

26:29.440 --> 26:31.090
I will seize

26:31.110 --> 26:33.290
this second chance at life.

26:33.830 --> 26:35.180
Anyone else would have done the same.

26:36.510 --> 26:37.050
So,

26:37.200 --> 26:38.490
cure my condition

26:39.160 --> 26:40.090
and you

26:40.350 --> 26:42.460
can have everything in this valley.

26:47.720 --> 26:48.900
What is it?

26:49.720 --> 26:51.140
You agreed to everything when you asked to be my disciple.

26:51.590 --> 26:52.530
You're regretting it now?

26:54.590 --> 26:55.460
I will not

26:56.310 --> 26:58.250
lie or betray you.

27:02.240 --> 27:03.010
But why

27:04.590 --> 27:06.460
have you never told me about this?

27:12.920 --> 27:15.010
You have read many scrolls in the past.

27:15.640 --> 27:16.980
Let me teach you

27:17.400 --> 27:18.900
a few more.

27:19.400 --> 27:21.140
Hide cleverness with clumsiness.

27:22.550 --> 27:23.940
Do good with discretion.

27:24.640 --> 27:26.700
Stay pure in this world of darkness.

27:28.000 --> 27:29.700
Treat concession as a way to advance.

27:31.070 --> 27:33.980
That's my motto.

27:38.400 --> 27:39.460
There are certain things

27:40.000 --> 27:40.940
that if I

27:40.960 --> 27:42.730
tell you upfront,

27:42.880 --> 27:44.900
you won't stay here loyally like you do now.

28:12.240 --> 28:13.530
And if I fail to ascend to Tier 4?

28:17.110 --> 28:18.330
You know how hard

28:19.550 --> 28:20.570
it is to cultivate.

28:21.790 --> 28:23.460
It took me two years to get

28:23.960 --> 28:25.660
from Tier 2 to Tier 3.

28:27.110 --> 28:28.730
And I'm stagnating now.

28:29.830 --> 28:31.490
Getting to Tier 4 in a year is harder

28:32.920 --> 28:34.010
than being an immortal.

28:34.680 --> 28:35.980
Enough.

28:36.350 --> 28:38.140
Do you think we're negotiating now?

28:39.400 --> 28:41.530
Continue cultivating as usual.

28:42.200 --> 28:44.810
I'll find those precious herbs for you.

28:46.240 --> 28:46.980
And don't mention

28:47.640 --> 28:48.570
this again.

28:50.070 --> 28:50.940
Like I said,

28:51.830 --> 28:53.330
get to Tier 4

28:53.750 --> 28:55.570
within a year.

29:40.680 --> 29:42.290
Hide cleverness with clumsiness.

29:42.880 --> 29:44.420
Do good with discretion.

29:45.030 --> 29:47.050
Stay pure in this world of darkness.

29:47.720 --> 29:49.250
Treat concession as a way to advance.

29:49.960 --> 29:52.940
That's my motto.

29:56.750 --> 29:57.380
Zhang Tie.

29:58.000 --> 29:59.180
- Wake up. - The dumpling is delicious.

30:01.880 --> 30:02.730
That's all

30:03.030 --> 30:04.250
you ever think of.

30:13.880 --> 30:15.050
I finally

30:15.550 --> 30:16.660
have the full picture now.

30:18.000 --> 30:18.700
I'm thinking

30:20.030 --> 30:20.810
that after I get

30:22.510 --> 30:23.490
to Tier 4 next year,

30:24.030 --> 30:25.180
I'll cure Master's condition.

30:25.960 --> 30:27.180
Then, we leave Shenshou Valley

30:27.640 --> 30:28.700
and open an apothecary.

30:31.830 --> 30:33.290
We'll live

30:35.110 --> 30:36.380
a comfortable life.

30:40.350 --> 30:40.860
Right?

31:41.070 --> 31:42.900
He has grown wary.

31:43.160 --> 31:45.010
It took me a while to reassure him last night.

31:45.400 --> 31:46.770
It's over

31:46.960 --> 31:48.420
if he runs away.

31:49.640 --> 31:50.900
Let me

31:51.200 --> 31:51.730
take over his body

31:53.000 --> 31:54.250
right away.

31:57.920 --> 31:59.330
No!

32:02.110 --> 32:03.180
Why not?

32:03.400 --> 32:04.940
He's not strong enough for you to take over yet.

32:04.960 --> 32:06.220
Do you want to be like me?

32:06.240 --> 32:08.700
Formless?

32:09.550 --> 32:11.700
You don't have time to find another disciple

32:11.790 --> 32:16.250
who can practice the Longevity Art.

32:16.510 --> 32:17.700
So we wait?

32:19.110 --> 32:21.290
You can feel

32:23.000 --> 32:25.730
that this body has run its course.

32:26.070 --> 32:27.140
You can't carry on?

32:28.200 --> 32:29.900
But carry on you must.

32:31.830 --> 32:33.810
I am an Immortal disciple.

32:34.920 --> 32:35.620
Do you expect me

32:36.590 --> 32:38.420
to die

32:39.240 --> 32:41.180
with a mortal like you?

32:43.680 --> 32:45.250
So we wait

32:46.960 --> 32:48.140
for a year maximum.

32:48.750 --> 32:50.490
I will take him, whether he has reached

32:51.350 --> 32:52.290
Tier 4 or not.

32:58.030 --> 32:58.530
Who's there?

34:06.550 --> 34:07.220
Zhang Tie.

34:09.510 --> 34:10.290
Zhang Tie!

34:26.880 --> 34:27.420
Master.

34:29.030 --> 34:30.140
Come in.

34:36.200 --> 34:36.730
Master,

34:37.310 --> 34:37.980
where is Zhang Tie?

34:39.350 --> 34:40.530
Zhang Tie?

34:43.480 --> 34:45.330
He didn't tell you he left the mountain?

34:45.960 --> 34:46.570
He left the mountain?

34:49.640 --> 34:51.330
He asked ten taels from me and said

34:52.070 --> 34:54.180
that he would leave the mountain for a while.

34:54.310 --> 34:54.900
Impossible.

34:55.200 --> 34:56.290
He always lets me know where he goes.

34:58.240 --> 35:00.860
I came clean to you just now.

35:01.750 --> 35:03.530
Why would I lie to you?

35:05.350 --> 35:06.620
Zhang Tie never leaves without a word.

35:08.350 --> 35:09.380
And if he truly has left the mountain,

35:09.590 --> 35:10.420
surely you know

35:10.720 --> 35:11.460
where he is going.

35:12.830 --> 35:13.460
If you won't tell me,

35:14.510 --> 35:15.290
I'll find him myself.

35:22.480 --> 35:24.420
As expected from a Tier 3 cultivator.

35:24.750 --> 35:26.730
You sensed my actions.

35:26.920 --> 35:29.290
My herbs have not gone to waste.

35:29.640 --> 35:31.460
I just want

35:31.590 --> 35:33.050
to read your pulse.

35:51.670 --> 35:52.380
Come,

35:52.800 --> 35:53.780
my dear disciple.

35:55.960 --> 35:57.010
I want

35:57.280 --> 35:59.740
to speak with you.

35:59.760 --> 36:00.940
Okay?

36:11.480 --> 36:12.340
You

36:12.440 --> 36:13.780
have been here for a while.

36:16.550 --> 36:17.490
Do you miss home?

36:18.440 --> 36:20.570
You once told me that you missed your sister

36:21.320 --> 36:23.820
from Qingniu Town.

36:25.710 --> 36:26.300
Master,

36:27.230 --> 36:28.690
let's not beat around the bush.

36:30.550 --> 36:31.490
Just say

36:32.150 --> 36:32.940
that you

36:33.480 --> 36:34.490
need my help.

36:35.110 --> 36:36.050
That's all.

36:37.480 --> 36:39.210
I can't do many things,

36:39.630 --> 36:40.900
but I know to be grateful.

36:41.920 --> 36:43.820
Why are you doing this to me?

36:46.230 --> 36:48.210
You are smart,

36:49.030 --> 36:49.940
prudent,

36:50.480 --> 36:51.690
and can't be controlled.

36:53.480 --> 36:55.170
But you care too much.

36:56.840 --> 36:58.210
And that

36:58.510 --> 37:00.570
is the greatest weakness we share.

37:00.760 --> 37:01.940
This is precisely why I don't want you

37:02.190 --> 37:03.860
to see Zhang Tie.

37:07.510 --> 37:08.300
Like I said,

37:09.710 --> 37:10.940
if you can save me,

37:11.550 --> 37:13.210
I'll promise you a life of riches.

37:17.550 --> 37:19.090
Let's have a wager.

37:20.670 --> 37:22.490
Let's see who dies first.

37:22.510 --> 37:23.340
Me,

37:23.670 --> 37:24.610
you,

37:25.960 --> 37:28.170
or the ones you hold dear?

37:33.070 --> 37:33.490
Fine.

37:35.320 --> 37:36.740
I'll reach Tier 4 in a year

37:37.440 --> 37:38.260
and cure you.

37:39.920 --> 37:41.420
Then, you tell me where Zhang Tie is.

37:43.230 --> 37:43.610
Also,

37:44.670 --> 37:46.090
the herbs you bring back are running out.

37:46.960 --> 37:47.610
I need more.

37:49.000 --> 37:50.210
Focus on your cultivating.

37:50.230 --> 37:51.130
I'll handle

37:51.920 --> 37:53.300
the herbs for you.

37:54.960 --> 37:55.380
Halt!

38:00.550 --> 38:02.050
Take this.

38:35.670 --> 38:37.340
Won't you ask what it is?

38:40.760 --> 38:41.490
Why should I?

38:43.280 --> 38:44.170
Remember

38:44.760 --> 38:46.570
what you promised me today next year.

38:59.440 --> 39:00.260
As expected,

39:01.150 --> 39:02.490
whatever bond between us

39:03.320 --> 39:04.860
disappears after that day.

39:05.670 --> 39:06.570
It can never turn back to the way it was.

39:08.440 --> 39:09.340
And now,

39:10.230 --> 39:12.010
Physician Mo has dropped all pretense.

39:12.760 --> 39:14.130
He often left to gather herbs.

39:15.320 --> 39:16.610
And when he returned,

39:17.320 --> 39:18.860
he looked weaker than before.

39:20.880 --> 39:22.650
How did it become like this?

39:23.480 --> 39:24.460
Or perhaps,

39:25.360 --> 39:26.740
it has always been like this.

39:27.590 --> 39:29.380
Those carefree years in the past

39:30.000 --> 39:31.260
seemed like an illusion.

39:32.550 --> 39:33.690
I've tried many ways

39:34.030 --> 39:35.570
but I failed to remove toxin he laid.

39:36.510 --> 39:38.610
It seems like I'll just have to attain Tier 4.

39:39.320 --> 39:40.130
But

39:41.000 --> 39:42.340
this is a tall order.

39:45.590 --> 39:46.300
Zhang Tie,

39:47.110 --> 39:48.090
I will find you

39:48.840 --> 39:50.050
wherever you are.

39:52.710 --> 39:54.090
Anyway, the Green Vial

39:54.630 --> 39:56.380
has lain silent for a while now.

41:15.030 --> 41:15.780
This is

41:16.280 --> 41:17.940
whatever it gets from condensing moonlight?

41:45.760 --> 41:46.380
Can I

41:46.710 --> 41:47.530
drink it?

41:52.400 --> 41:52.900
Oh, no.

41:53.400 --> 41:54.420
Physician Mo's bird.

42:12.280 --> 42:13.740
I have to cultivate.

42:14.320 --> 42:14.900
Stop staring at me.

42:15.360 --> 42:16.050
Just leave.

42:34.550 --> 42:35.490
Where did the rabbit come from?

42:39.630 --> 42:40.650
Go away already.

43:20.360 --> 43:20.740
It...

43:21.440 --> 43:22.050
It exploded?

43:22.670 --> 43:23.530
That rabbit.

43:31.440 --> 43:32.980
What is in the vial?

43:40.000 --> 43:40.980
Poison?

43:49.000 --> 43:49.980
They grow so quickly.

43:52.070 --> 43:52.900
Is it because of the liquid?

44:14.320 --> 44:15.490
If the diluted solution

44:15.800 --> 44:16.460
has this effect,

44:17.400 --> 44:18.340
let's try the undiluted solution.

44:34.030 --> 44:34.380
This...

44:34.630 --> 44:35.130
This is...

44:46.400 --> 44:47.610
A normal red sage

44:48.440 --> 44:50.130
has grown several hundred years old in an instant.

44:53.150 --> 44:53.860
This liquid

44:54.880 --> 44:56.780
must have something to do with those mutations.

44:58.880 --> 45:00.170
Animals can't take it.

45:00.960 --> 45:02.740
But it can be used on herbs to speed up

45:03.480 --> 45:04.260
their growth.

45:10.880 --> 45:12.170
However, there isn't a lot of liquid.

45:13.150 --> 45:15.650
It needs to absorb moonlight at night.

45:21.110 --> 45:21.860
Perhaps

45:22.590 --> 45:24.420
I can dilute it with water like

45:24.880 --> 45:25.740
my previous experiment.

45:27.320 --> 45:27.780
Furthermore,

45:28.480 --> 45:29.690
I need to find somewhere remote

45:30.400 --> 45:31.170
to grow many herbs,

45:32.030 --> 45:32.740
refine many pills,

45:33.590 --> 45:34.740
and ingest them.

45:37.360 --> 45:38.860
This is how I can make a comeback.

47:10.550 --> 47:12.300
Did you see him?

47:15.840 --> 47:17.530
Is he cultivating?

47:21.590 --> 47:23.380
Good.

47:25.280 --> 47:26.300
It seems like

47:26.480 --> 47:28.300
he has accepted his fate.

47:30.500 --> 47:32.500
[Armored Puppet]

48:43.000 --> 48:44.130
Growing these mystic herbs

48:44.630 --> 48:46.380
to around three hundred years old should be enough.

48:47.030 --> 48:48.460
If I follow the pill recipes in the book and make them into pills,

48:48.800 --> 48:49.690
I'll have more than I can count.

49:00.960 --> 49:01.650
This many

49:02.280 --> 49:02.900
should be enough.

49:12.800 --> 49:13.940
Yellow Dragon Pill can strengthen my power.

49:14.800 --> 49:16.130
Golden Marrow Pill can boost my Meridian system.

49:16.960 --> 49:17.650
If I take them together,

49:18.550 --> 49:19.380
their effect will be amplified.

50:02.400 --> 50:02.900
Oh, no.

50:03.590 --> 50:04.570
If this carries on,

50:05.000 --> 50:06.570
my Meridian system will be overwhelmed by these herbs.

50:07.150 --> 50:08.210
I need to circulate my energy to progress further.

50:32.460 --> 50:35.420
[Longevity Art, Tier 4]

51:42.110 --> 51:43.340
Is this the power of Tier 4?

51:44.800 --> 51:45.740
I can now

51:46.440 --> 51:47.490
understand the greatness

51:47.670 --> 51:48.940
of this unnamed mantra.

51:49.960 --> 51:51.860
I can sense the beings around me.

51:53.480 --> 51:53.980
No.

51:54.590 --> 51:55.460
Sensing them

51:56.000 --> 51:56.820
is not enough.

52:30.670 --> 52:31.170
Not enough.

52:32.110 --> 52:32.820
Still not enough.

52:34.030 --> 52:34.900
Perception alone

52:35.230 --> 52:36.820
is not enough to fight Physician Mo.

52:37.880 --> 52:38.820
I need to be stronger.

52:57.000 --> 52:58.130
Sorry to keep you waiting, Han Li.

52:59.440 --> 53:00.050
Senior Li,

53:00.440 --> 53:01.260
you're swift.

53:01.760 --> 53:03.010
But you arrived first.

53:05.510 --> 53:06.570
This Serpentine Art

53:06.920 --> 53:07.690
is too brutal.

53:07.710 --> 53:08.460
It doesn't suit me.

53:09.760 --> 53:11.980
Do you have anything more subtle?

53:13.150 --> 53:14.010
I do.

53:14.880 --> 53:15.610
Han Li,

53:16.150 --> 53:17.170
tell me honestly.

53:17.710 --> 53:18.980
Did you cross someone?

53:19.550 --> 53:20.820
If there's someone who wants to hurt you,

53:20.880 --> 53:21.650
let me know.

53:21.760 --> 53:22.980
I won't let them bully you.

53:25.190 --> 53:26.740
You can't help me forever.

53:27.960 --> 53:29.170
You study the art of healing.

53:30.320 --> 53:31.690
Surely your master has taught you

53:32.360 --> 53:33.340
to use

53:33.960 --> 53:34.690
poison

53:35.070 --> 53:36.210
to fight your enemy.

53:39.150 --> 53:40.050
Right.

53:40.920 --> 53:41.740
That's a strategy.

53:43.480 --> 53:44.780
But one can never

53:45.000 --> 53:45.900
have too many strategies.

53:49.400 --> 53:50.050
All right.

53:50.510 --> 53:51.420
What do you want to learn?

53:57.760 --> 53:58.740
I want to be agile,

53:59.480 --> 54:00.420
to use throwing weapons,

54:01.190 --> 54:02.260
and a way to defeat enemies

54:02.630 --> 54:04.300
without relying on my qi.

54:05.360 --> 54:05.940
For example,

54:06.550 --> 54:07.050
Misty Step.

54:09.400 --> 54:10.650
Misty Step?

54:11.800 --> 54:13.650
You want to learn my secret technique?

54:14.190 --> 54:15.210
Will you teach me or not?

54:17.030 --> 54:18.610
Just because I can use it with ease

54:18.630 --> 54:20.130
doesn't mean it's easy.

54:20.320 --> 54:21.900
It took me five years

54:21.920 --> 54:23.170
to master it roughly.

54:27.670 --> 54:28.940
I don't have much time,

54:30.440 --> 54:31.980
but I'm willing to learn from you.

54:35.920 --> 54:37.420
It seems like I have to demonstrate a few tricks myself

54:37.510 --> 54:39.210
to convince you otherwise.

54:39.630 --> 54:40.420
Look carefully.

55:11.030 --> 55:11.940
At this point,

55:12.710 --> 55:14.010
I am not gullible enough to believe

55:14.590 --> 55:15.610
that Physician Mo will spare me

55:15.920 --> 55:16.900
once I attain Tier 4

55:17.440 --> 55:18.340
and cure him.

55:19.590 --> 55:20.570
I need a way

55:21.150 --> 55:22.690
to defend myself should the situation call for it.

56:51.260 --> 56:56.580
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

56:57.900 --> 57:03.300
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

57:03.420 --> 57:06.620
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

57:06.860 --> 57:09.100
♪Old scenes rise again♪

57:09.500 --> 57:12.340
♪Too hard to forget♪

57:12.860 --> 57:16.820
♪Easier just to miss♪

57:17.660 --> 57:23.140
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

57:24.300 --> 57:29.580
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

57:30.180 --> 57:33.220
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

57:33.500 --> 57:35.620
♪Swept away by time♪

57:36.260 --> 57:38.900
♪Eyes once looked far♪

57:39.380 --> 57:43.340
♪Now lost in the shift♪

57:43.820 --> 57:46.660
♪Autumn winds stir♪

57:46.940 --> 57:48.860
♪Smoke curls once more♪

57:49.300 --> 57:51.740
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

57:52.060 --> 57:55.580
♪Returning to my eyes♪

57:56.140 --> 57:59.100
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

57:59.420 --> 58:02.340
♪Time lost its name♪

58:02.740 --> 58:05.580
♪Was it yesterday♪

58:05.980 --> 58:09.540
♪Or tomorrow?♪

58:09.900 --> 58:12.740
♪The world has changed♪

58:13.140 --> 58:14.980
♪Beyond recall♪

58:15.540 --> 58:17.260
♪Time will fade♪

58:17.660 --> 58:22.460
♪All the words ever spoken♪

58:23.140 --> 58:26.020
♪Only this longing remains♪

58:26.500 --> 58:31.780
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

58:32.900 --> 58:39.540
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

58:40.020 --> 58:49.740
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
